  "id": "confluence",
  "term": "confluence",
  "definition": "Confluence refers to different large-scale problems or forces coming together at the same time in ways that interact and intensify their combined effects. In this context, it describes how overlapping crises can reinforce one another and increase risks to wellbeing and mental health.",
